Description: Voicemeeter-like audio routing frontend for PipeWire
 Pulsemeeter is a GTK 4 frontend that makes PipeWire's audio routing
 easy to use, following a workflow similar to Voicemeeter.
 .
 It can create virtual input and output devices, route audio from any
 input to any hardware or virtual output, control volume and mute, set
 channel layouts and port mappings, and move application streams
 between devices.
